    "selected_method": "grade_median (with KNN option in pipeline)",
    "justification": "Loan-grade-wise median imputation reduces loan_int_rate RMSE by over 66% compared to global median imputation (from ~3.23% down to ~1.07%) because interest rates are strongly stratified by lender-assigned loan_grade (Spearman r = 0.93). KNN Imputation (k=5) achieves comparable accuracy (~1.16% RMSE on loan_int_rate and slightly better RMSE on person_emp_length due to age/income correlation), while grade-wise median is deterministic, transparent, and preserves 100% consistency with Member 1's validated dataset."
